## Temperatureswitch
# See http://smoothieware.org/temperatureswitch
# Automatically toggle a switch at a specified temperature. Different ones of these may be defined to monitor different temperatures and switch different swithxes
# Useful to turn on a fan or water pump to cool the hotend
temperatureswitch.hotend.enable              true             #
temperatureswitch.hotend.designator          T                # first character of the temperature control designator to use as the temperature sensor to monitor
temperatureswitch.hotend.switch              hotendfan        # select which switch to use, matches the name of the defined switch
temperatureswitch.hotend.threshold_temp      60.0             # temperature to turn on (if rising) or off the switch
temperatureswitch.hotend.heatup_poll         5                # poll heatup at 5 sec intervals
temperatureswitch.hotend.cooldown_poll       60               # poll cooldown at 60 sec intervals

temperatureswitch.exhaust.enable             true             #
temperatureswitch.exhaust.designator         B                # first character of the temperature control designator to use as the temperature sensor to monitor
temperatureswitch.exhaust.switch             exhaustfan       # select which switch to use, matches the name of the defined switch
temperatureswitch.exhaust.threshold_temp     50.0             # temperature to turn on (if rising) or off the switch
temperatureswitch.exhaust.heatup_poll        15               # poll heatup at 15 sec intervals
temperatureswitch.exhaust.cooldown_poll      60               # poll cooldown at 60 sec intervals

temperatureswitch.electron.enable            true             #
temperatureswitch.electron.designator        B                # first character of the temperature control designator to use as the temperature sensor to monitor
temperatureswitch.electron.switch            electronicsfan   # select which switch to use, matches the name of the defined switch
temperatureswitch.electron.threshold_temp    50.0             # temperature to turn on (if rising) or off the switch
temperatureswitch.electron.heatup_poll       15               # poll heatup at 15 sec intervals
temperatureswitch.electron.cooldown_poll     60               # poll cooldown at 60 sec intervals


